          "type": "callout",
          "icon": "📦",
          "color": "green",
          "text": "**Latest project — Union Paper.** An internal logistics platform: rail import tracking, a delivery desk with a live map, a Telegram bot and a Flutter driver app. [Read the case study →](/projects/union-paper)"
